The static path review confirms the only material abstraction is the supplied keyed-sort bridge: symbolic execution evaluates and calls `order_by_points`, but the builtin rewrites directly to the opaque `sortKeyVS(VS, digitSumClosure)` without invoking `digit_sum`. I’m testing non-vacuity next with a reachable singleton input and a deliberately false empty-list result.
